<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        a {
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Hello <%= approverName %>,</p>
    <p><%= userName %> has submitted a document titled <strong>"<%= documentName %>"</strong> for your review and approval.</p>

    <p><strong>Document Summary:</strong></p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= documentName %></li>
        <li><strong>Submitted By:</strong> <%= userName %></li>
        <li><strong>Submission Date:</strong> <%= submissionDate %></li>
        <li><strong>Description:</strong> <%= documentDescription %></li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>What You Need to Do:</strong></p>
    <p>Please review the document and provide your approval or feedback. Click the link below to access the document:</p>
    <p><a href="<%= documentLink %>" target="_blank">Review Document</a></p>

    <p>Thank you for your attention to this matter!</p>

    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p><%= companyName %> Team</p>
</body>
</html>
